findings.comment:
6-501.11: The following structural issues remain to be addressed:
1) doorway to the processing area needs to be properly sealed (exposed brick);
2) 3 part sink in main building needs to be sealed to the wall; 
3) wall below the handwashing sink in the main building needs to be sealed (gaps located under the sink on the left side and at the wall seam in the corner); 
5) gaps need to be sealed in the restroom where the walls meet the ceiling;
6) shelving in the fry shack needs to be replaced;  and
7) surfaces around windows in the fry shack need to be re-sealed.
Owner is in the process of making repairs and changing out equipment.
Physical facilities shall be maintained in good repair.
